{
    "id":  11652,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Track Spotlight 30W PARIS White Single-Phase Track | Bridgelux Chip | UGR11 | 24º",
    "reference":  "TLWM30W-NW-91397",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePARIS 30W LED Track Spotlight,\u003c/strong\u003e equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eBridgelux COB Chip 110 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e24º optics and UGR11\u003c/strong\u003e, offers focused glare-free light for total visual comfort, ideal for highlighting key areas. Its high color rendering index \u003cstrong\u003e(CRI \u0026gt;82)\u003c/strong\u003e and flicker-free technology \u003cstrong\u003e(NO FLICK)\u003c/strong\u003e guarantee visual comfort and color fidelity.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts compact and elegant design makes it perfect for shops, galleries, and modern spaces demanding aesthetics and performance.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Spotlight 30W PARIS White Single-Phase Track | Bridgelux Chip | UGR11 - 24º\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePARIS 30W LED track spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e has been designed to deliver technical, modern and highly efficient lighting in environments where light quality and design are essential. Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-efficiency Bridgelux COB chip (110 lm/W)\u003c/strong\u003e, it guarantees a powerful, constant luminous flux, ideal for commercial and architectural applications.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003e24º beam optics\u003c/strong\u003e provide \u003cstrong\u003eprecise, directional lighting\u003c/strong\u003e, perfect for highlighting key elements such as products in display cabinets, works of art, exhibition areas or architectural details. In addition, its low glare index (\u003cstrong\u003eUGR11\u003c/strong\u003e) ensures exceptional visual comfort, even in spaces where the customer spends time looking closely at things.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith a \u003cstrong\u003ecolour rendering index (CRI \u0026gt;82)\u003c/strong\u003e, this model offers a realistic and faithful representation of colours, which is essential in environments where colour perception influences the user experience or the purchase decision, such as fashion stores, galleries, jewellers, showrooms and design studios.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNO FLICK (flicker-free)\u003c/strong\u003e technology makes this spotlight suitable for sensitive spaces such as clinics, beauty centres, offices or creative working environments, where stable light prevents visual fatigue and improves wellbeing.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDesign and compatibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ecompact, elegant design\u003c/strong\u003e of the PARIS model adapts easily to modern, minimalist interiors, fitting into single-phase tracks without the need for complicated installation work. Its high-quality housing guarantees durability, good heat dissipation and a professional appearance. Available in white, it combines easily with light or neutral ceilings and structures.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRecommended uses and applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRetail / clothing and fashion stores:\u003c/strong\u003e highlights products, mannequins and display windows.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShowrooms and exhibitions:\u003c/strong\u003e creates focused, elegant atmospheres.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArt galleries and museums:\u003c/strong\u003e illuminates artworks without altering their colour perception.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHotels and hospitality spaces:\u003c/strong\u003e brings a sophisticated, warm atmosphere.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreative offices and design studios:\u003c/strong\u003e promotes concentration and visual fidelity.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWindow dressing:\u003c/strong\u003e directs attention to strategic points of the display.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClinics, beauty or wellness centres:\u003c/strong\u003e clean, flicker-free lighting for greater customer comfort.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern restaurants and cafés:\u003c/strong\u003e to highlight bar areas, products or décor.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical datasheet for each LED product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
